    sets := #["msh"] },
  { id := 69, comment := "\"Do this only once each turn\" lets you choose whether or not to have the Villain connive as the triggered ability resolves. If you don't, the ability will trigger again the next time the condition is met. Once you choose to do so, the ability will no longer trigger for the rest of the turn and any other instances of the ability that have already triggered and are on the stack won't have any effect.",
