    sets := #["msh"] },
  { id := 115, comment := "Each token created by Multiversal Incursion copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else, with the listed exception (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn't copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. If it is a Vehicle, it is not crewed.",
