  { id := 172, comment := "If an ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that first ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to \"the exiled card,\" it refers to all cards exiled by the first ability and the copy. For example, if the second ability of Hoarding Dragon from the Foundations release (\"When this creature enters, you may search your library for an artifact card, exile it, then shuffle.\") is copied and two cards are exiled, then when Hoarding Dragon's third ability (\"When this creature dies, you may put the exiled card into its owner's hand.\") later resolves, if you choose to put \"the exiled card\" into its owner's hand, both exiled cards will be put into their owners' hands.",
